<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακῑάθω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰθ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		 Verb, only impf. or aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετεκίαθον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>follow after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππῆες δ᾽ ὀλίγον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.52
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.532
			</span></i>: c.acc., <i>chase</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρῶας καὶ Λυκίους μετεκίαθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.685
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν δὲ κύνες μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.581
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>visit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ὁ μὲν Αἰθίοπας μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				46
			</span></i>; <i>go to seek</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.802
			</span></i>; simply, <i>come to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.1221
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλ᾽ ὅτε πᾶν πεδίον μετεκίαθον</span>
			<i>had passed through</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.714
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> intr.,
				<i>come next</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.139
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
